From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luke Craig <lacraig3@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] replay: stub analysis register effects without TCG

Register writes join RAM writes in the ordered analysis effect event (the
engine/src/replay overlay). Without TCG there is no replay engine, so the
request is unavailable, as the RAM request already is.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
Origin: new
---
 replay/stubs-system.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/replay/stubs-system.c b/replay/stubs-system.c
index 2018b72bd7a645a947a01bd782f4d07c3dee4a08..8e1ba878362c2869becbb6caf7d9869d895d6655 100644
--- a/replay/stubs-system.c
+++ b/replay/stubs-system.c
@@ -140,3 +140,9 @@ bool replay_analysis_ram_write_request(uint64_t address, const uint8_t *data,
 {
     return false;
 }
+
+bool replay_analysis_reg_write_request(int cpu_index, int reg,
+                                        const uint8_t *data, uint32_t length)
+{
+    return false;
+}
